  50:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** File    : SEGGER_RTT.c
  51:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** Purpose : Implementation of SEGGER real-time transfer (RTT) which
  52:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           allows real-time communication on targets which support
  53:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           debugger memory accesses while the CPU is running.
  54:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** Revision: $Rev: 26642 $
  55:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** 
  56:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** Additional information:
  57:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           Type "int" is assumed to be 32-bits in size
  58:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           H->T    Host to target communication
  59:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           T->H    Target to host communication
  60:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** 
  61:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           RTT channel 0 is always present and reserved for Terminal usage.
  62:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           Name is fixed to "Terminal"
  63:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** 
  64:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           Effective buffer size: SizeOfBuffer - 1
  65:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** 
  66:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           WrOff == RdOff:       Buffer is empty
  67:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           WrOff == (RdOff - 1): Buffer is full
  68:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           WrOff >  RdOff:       Free space includes wrap-around
  69:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           WrOff <  RdOff:       Used space includes wrap-around
  70:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****           (WrOff == (SizeOfBuffer - 1)) && (RdOff == 0):  
  71:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c ****                                 Buffer full and wrap-around after next byte
  72:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** 
  73:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** 
  74:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  75:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
  76:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** 
