 428:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT ring buffer
 429:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    and updates the associated write pointer which is periodically
