 816:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 817:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *       SEGGER_RTT_WriteWithOverwriteNoLock
 818:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 819:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
 820:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT
 821:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    control block.
 822:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    SEGGER_RTT_WriteWithOverwriteNoLock does not lock the application 
 823:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    and overwrites data if the data does not fit into the buffer.
 824:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 825:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
 826:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Up"-buffer to be used (e.g. 0 for "Terminal").
 827:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to character array. Does not need to point to a \0 terminated string.
 828:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    NumBytes     Number of bytes to be stored in the SEGGER RTT control block.
 829:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 830:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Notes
 831:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (1) If there is not enough space in the "Up"-buffer, data is overwritten.
 832:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (2) For performance reasons this function does not call Init()
 833:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        and may only be called after RTT has been initialized.
 834:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        Either by calling SEGGER_RTT_Init() or calling another RTT API function first.
 835:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (3) Do not use SEGGER_RTT_WriteWithOverwriteNoLock if a J-Link 
 836:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        connection reads RTT data.
 837:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
