1004:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1005:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
1006:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT
1007:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    control block inside a <Down> buffer.
1008:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    SEGGER_RTT_WriteDownBufferNoLock does not lock the application.
1009:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Used to do the same operation that J-Link does, to transfer 
1010:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    RTT data from other channels, such as TCP/IP or UART.
1011:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1012:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
1013:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Down"-buffer to be used.
1014:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to character array. Does not need to point to a \0 terminated string.
1015:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    NumBytes     Number of bytes to be stored in the SEGGER RTT control block.
1016:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1017:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
1018:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes which have been stored in the "Down"-buffer.
1019:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1020:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Notes
1021:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (1) Data is stored according to buffer flags.
1022:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (2) For performance reasons this function does not call Init()
1023:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        and may only be called after RTT has been initialized.
1024:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        Either by calling SEGGER_RTT_Init() or calling another RTT API function first.
1025:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1026:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Additional information
1027:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    This function must not be called when J-Link might also do RTT.
1028:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
