1158:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1159:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
1160:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT control block in a <Down> buffer.
1161:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1162:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
1163:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Up"-buffer to be used (e.g. 0 for "Terminal").
1164:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to character array. Does not need to point to a \0 terminated string.
1165:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    NumBytes     Number of bytes to be stored in the SEGGER RTT control block.
1166:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1167:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
1168:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes which have been stored in the "Down"-buffer.
1169:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1170:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Notes
1171:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (1) Data is stored according to buffer flags.
1172:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1173:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Additional information
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccRade8p.s 			page 51


1174:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    This function must not be called when J-Link might also do RTT.
1175:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    This function locks against all other RTT operations. I.e. during
1176:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    the write operation, writing from the application is also locked.
1177:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    If only one consumer writes to the down buffer, 
1178:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    call SEGGER_RTT_WriteDownBufferNoLock() instead.
1179:./Application/Addition/RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
